<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">LITTLE THINGS, BIG JOY</view><view class="title">为小快乐打工。</view><view class="muted">给努力一个具体的小奖励。</view><view class="presets"><button wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="name" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choose"><text class="icon">{{item.icon}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="hint">¥{{item.price}}</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="field-label">我的小目标</view><input class="input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="20" placeholder="写下想给自己的小奖励" /><view class="field-label">目标金额（元）</view><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{price}}" data-field="price" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="10" /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary save" bindtap="save">就为这个小快乐 →</button></view><view class="hint">目标只是生活的小期待，不用为了凑进度加班。收入达到目标后，还能看到今天赚到了几份小快乐。</view></view>
